1
00:00:00,119 --> 00:00:04,259
(Leonard:)Or we could mix things up.
Maybe pick names out of a hat, whatever.

2
00:00:04,423 --> 00:00:07,493
(Penny:)Whoa, whoa, whoa.

3
00:00:07,659 --> 00:00:10,469
(Penny:)Why don't you just admit you don't
want to be on a team with me.

4
00:00:10,629 --> 00:00:12,509
I just said, "Couples sound great."

5
00:00:12,664 --> 00:00:14,474
(Penny:)Mm-hmm, yeah, you don't
think I'm smart enough.

6
00:00:14,633 --> 00:00:16,343
(Penny:)You think I'm gonna be a liability.

7
00:00:16,502 --> 00:00:19,142
(Penny:)Even though I totally just used
the word "liability" correctly

8
00:00:19,304 --> 00:00:20,904
(Penny:)in a sentence.

9
00:00:22,441 --> 00:00:24,281
(Leonard:)Yeah.

10
00:00:24,443 --> 00:00:26,753
No, let's do couples. I want to.

11
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:29,292
No, no, no. Let's mix things up.

12
00:00:29,448 --> 00:00:31,358
(Penny:)I choose Sheldon,
and we're gonna kick your ass!

13
00:00:31,517 --> 00:00:33,757
Yeah-- really?

14
00:00:33,919 --> 00:00:35,519
(Sheldon:)The only time I'm ever
picked first for a team

15
00:00:35,687 --> 00:00:37,757
(Sheldon:)and I'm stuck with the liability?

16
00:00:39,591 --> 00:00:41,591
(Amy:)Stop that.
Penny is not a liability.

17
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,500
(Sheldon:)Thank you.
Do you want to be on my team?

18
00:00:43,662 --> 00:00:45,802
(Amy:)Maybe we pick names out of a hat.

19
00:00:48,867 --> 00:00:50,607
(Penny:)Hurry up and close the door
so they can't hear us.

20
00:00:55,941 --> 00:01:00,021
(Penny:)Would you stop pouting?
So, you picked my name. Get over it.

